
@startuml RBciAD_GA_Vertical_v3
title RBciAD: Real-Time Polyglot No-/Low-Code Framework
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam Padding 12
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor Black
  BorderThickness 1.0
  RoundCorner 18
  FontSize 18
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #f7f7f7
  BorderColor #999999
  FontSize 14
}

top to bottom direction

rectangle "No-/Low-Code GUI\nNode-based editor\n• Palette (Base/Custom)\n• Drag & connect\n• In-node params" as GUI #E6F0FF

rectangle "Reactive Engine (RxPy)\nDeterministic propagation\n• BehaviorSubjects\n• Selective recompute\n• Gentle throttling" as RX #EAF7EA

rectangle "Polyglot Execution\nOut-of-process\n• Python (in-process)\n• C/C++ • Rust • JS\n• JSON I/O wrapper" as POLY #FFF3E6

rectangle "EEG Applications\nReader • Filter • Visualizer\n• Clinical-style traces\n• LSL replay/generator" as EEG #F3E6FF

GUI -down-> RX : user edits\\n(no Run button)
RX -down-> POLY : compute steps\\n(triggered by changes)
POLY -down-> EEG : results → display\\n(real-time updates)

note left of GUI: No-code for novices\nLow-code for developers
note right of RX: Reactive graph\nQt event loop + RxPy
note left of POLY: Wrapper writes:\ninput_<name>_<id>.json\\noutput_<name>_<id>.json
note right of EEG: KPIs: TTFP ≈ 0.05–0.08 s\nEdit→Redraw P95 < 65 ms\\nDropped = 0 %

legend bottom
  Interactive • Reproducible • Open Source
endlegend

@enduml
